     This node type supports only the generic control messages.

SSHHUUTTDDOOWWNN
     This node shuts down upon receipt of a NGM_SHUTDOWN control message.  Do
     not do this, since the new iippffww node can only be created by reloading the
     nngg__iippffww module.

